{
"file": 478,
"paths": [
"d008/d024/f026"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "e4a6b8cf",
"en_raw": "Hey, about the portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "14ad2e51",
"en_raw": "Hey, sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "c4d48e55",
"en_raw": "when you're busy"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "d2ad12f8",
"en_raw": "I'm not busy, what is it?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "98b75df1",
"en_raw": "About that portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "2de79469",
"en_raw": "They say that person can draw spirits"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "2c7a618a",
"en_raw": "Really?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "5ae371a9",
"en_raw": "...That's the story, yes"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "e0654b9f",
"en_raw": "Why don't you get one drawn?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "8204cb8e",
"en_raw": "Are you telling me to"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "17172865",
"en_raw": "throw my allowance down the drain?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "422a9daa",
"en_raw": "Then don't, if you like"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "004a633d",
"en_raw": "Don't you have more useful info?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e46befe1",
"en_raw": "...It's easy to deny things"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "eafd2519",
"en_raw": "by your own yardstick"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "973748a9",
"en_raw": "but you can't know"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "893eae96",
"en_raw": "what other people"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "c668a895",
"en_raw": "can really do, right?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "6ee1dd62",
"en_raw": "I don't think it's bad"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "c6855cb9",
"en_raw": "to try engaging with them, at least"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "e4910468",
"en_raw": "Right, then, if I feel like it"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "89dc17c9",
"en_raw": "Certainly, there are people who can"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0b9c283b",
"en_raw": "spin a stick twelve hours"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4f32ec3d",
"en_raw": "without rest..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3bd22f9b",
"en_raw": "That's not true"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "b3cccb18",
"en_raw": "He rests properly"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "c1b5de66",
"en_raw": "I've never seen him rest"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "7bcf3af1",
"en_raw": "By chance"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "03942332",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "b1cbad1a",
"en_raw": "Sorry to intrude"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "0a86c771",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, um"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "17529c20",
"en_raw": "I wanted to ask about"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b8de6071",
"en_raw": "the portrait artist in the park..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "b7376d14",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, he's always there, right?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "17466af4",
"en_raw": "Frankly, what kind of person is he?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "e13d05c1",
"en_raw": "Hey, are you listening?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "7af035f6",
"en_raw": "...Not my business"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "4c298a7b",
"en_raw": "Listen"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "2528c21d",
"en_raw": "to a middle schooler asking"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "c987403d",
"en_raw": "this earnestly"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "df1fcc89",
"en_raw": "isn't that kind of attitude wrong?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "422e35b0",
"en_raw": "Answering a kid's question"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a4474c06",
"en_raw": "with sincerity is"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "c9a625da",
"en_raw": "a sensible adult's duty, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "799875c8",
"en_raw": "...No, I'm fine"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "25fe2ef9",
"en_raw": "Mister"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8583b4cf",
"en_raw": "Is that okay for a life?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "de92e383",
"en_raw": "I don't claim rights"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "d7d70747",
"en_raw": "so I don't need duties..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "967560b6",
"en_raw": "I'm a citizen of my own country"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "68b65b14",
"en_raw": "You're Japanese, aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2d2c30eb",
"en_raw": "The place I was born was Japan"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c7274b67",
"en_raw": "that's all there is to it"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "982d21b7",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "064c3f28",
"en_raw": "I'm tired..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "84cc8b68",
"en_raw": "That portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "06623b43",
"en_raw": "is he that talented?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "f1134493",
"en_raw": "Well, I suppose"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "982d21b7",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "6d3c9f2c",
"en_raw": "I've been wondering..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ebe5ff70",
"en_raw": "about the portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "5ae12f79",
"en_raw": "you said he's young"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "09d4bac8",
"en_raw": "...What's wrong with that?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "3fd979bb",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b25dab4b",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, mister"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "203e2841",
"en_raw": "That portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "247a45f1",
"en_raw": "do you know him well?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "5b2b8409",
"en_raw": "I know"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "418d0b83",
"en_raw": "A young man like that, society"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "fd7ac784",
"en_raw": "calls it having talent, I suppose"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "38ddf18d",
"en_raw": "Hmm, so he has talent..."
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0a0dd23c",
"en_raw": "But well,"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "b9e925e1",
"en_raw": "if you ask me..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "9b59d847",
"en_raw": "If I ask?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "07fbd2c9",
"en_raw": "...He's still young"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "59db401b",
"en_raw": "You're acting high and mighty, mister"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "37e9d284",
"en_raw": "No, no,"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "444c63d3",
"en_raw": "young isn't"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "e9f62bf0",
"en_raw": "meant in a bad way"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "615df613",
"en_raw": "...It's just that his works"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "e8744ad3",
"en_raw": "still feel like they have too many thorns"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "e2b0006c",
"en_raw": "Everything needs growth rings"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "2d816d2f",
"en_raw": "That's a declaration of defeat"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "156f0b79",
"en_raw": "Oh, win or lose"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "7f488f75",
"en_raw": "mine"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "9fad57af",
"en_raw": "was a pastime from the start"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "e8fad0f7",
"en_raw": "When you're young, try everything"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "5e8dcd7b",
"en_raw": "...And don't forget school studies"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "c254eb34",
"en_raw": "...You hit a sore spot casually"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "b121afcd",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "3b7dcc51",
"en_raw": "Yahoo, girl!"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "f3a94c11",
"en_raw": "Earning experience points?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "792a1e3d",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, sorry"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "c3e54c43",
"en_raw": "about what we were talking about"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "414eb810",
"en_raw": "The portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "6855e938",
"en_raw": "...what's the real story?"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "abd34a95",
"en_raw": "Today, about that portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "98078412",
"en_raw": "I, you see,"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "8f4b939a",
"en_raw": "came because of a rumor"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "6e4ab57d",
"en_raw": "Is he really great?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "3819f4bd",
"en_raw": "Oh, that guy?"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "690ac799",
"en_raw": "That guy's the worst"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "15817040",
"en_raw": "Far from great, just a pervert"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "1d626062",
"en_raw": "And yet"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "94cb9a7f",
"en_raw": "he acts all cool"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "22fca8b3",
"en_raw": "so very mistaken"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "4b05bf76",
"en_raw": "Sounds like I'll hear something good"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "775baefe",
"en_raw": "Sure, I'll tell you anything"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "1473c1a2",
"en_raw": "I love badmouthing him"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "a784111a",
"en_raw": "He seems popular lately"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "07cb715d",
"en_raw": "but I'm telling you for your own good"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "3df118b8",
"en_raw": "you should handle him"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "8a94e880",
"en_raw": "with great care"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "ced2e9fb",
"en_raw": "That's the plan, so I came to ask"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "9552b70f",
"en_raw": "Ha, right"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "34e3e156",
"en_raw": "That guy, you see, once"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "70d327ad",
"en_raw": "talked to me"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "878b36f0",
"en_raw": "once"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "03ac2fea",
"en_raw": "Denying civilization or whatever"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "d2af61fe",
"en_raw": "I don't know, but"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "d92a1b45",
"en_raw": "he picks on people's hobbies"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "4b602c68",
"en_raw": "Saying I shouldn't"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "df1d60de",
"en_raw": "listen to this kind of music"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "e18e726e",
"en_raw": "He took off my headphones without asking"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "2113d602",
"en_raw": "I snapped"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "e1167803",
"en_raw": "and said mind your own business"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "19df37b6",
"en_raw": "In his terms, I am"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "86109a61",
"en_raw": "a polluted person, apparently"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "5ed9b386",
"en_raw": "...What is that?"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "f5aff671",
"en_raw": "Funny, right?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "38477edd",
"en_raw": "I'll concede"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "09b6289a",
"en_raw": "that littering cigarettes"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "a6faa596",
"en_raw": "is wrong"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "3de9ee94",
"en_raw": "and throwing batteries in ponds"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "94ce8891",
"en_raw": "is wrong too"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "6d742fa7",
"en_raw": "But I don't want even"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "490d7790",
"en_raw": "the music I listen to put down"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "52462ee8",
"en_raw": "Music is a person's style"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "43062313",
"en_raw": "Hmm, that's like, for example"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "19d80a53",
"en_raw": "someone denying"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "f0caa09e",
"en_raw": "the author I like?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "11fb4f8b",
"en_raw": "That's it, that's it!"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "7a36c3e7",
"en_raw": "Right? Doesn't it make you furious?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "88d39e1e",
"en_raw": "There's more, too"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "82e47413",
"en_raw": "He says today's world is wrong"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "d09ac6dc",
"en_raw": "and nags about every little thing"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "8188419c",
"en_raw": "If you hate the present that much"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "a14ae878",
"en_raw": "just die, I say"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "d9ff437e",
"en_raw": "Anyway, he's"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "4a835c5e",
"en_raw": "in the top five"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "5deaccb6",
"en_raw": "of adults you shouldn't become"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "3f9acdee",
"en_raw": "...Still, even so"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "cd2bae20",
"en_raw": "talking to him"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "8aec5822",
"en_raw": "I do recommend"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "101c9b40",
"en_raw": "Life, everything is experience points"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "6cb61d49",
"en_raw": "You'll see right away when you talk to him"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "b9bbefbe",
"en_raw": "How should I say it, that guy"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "fa2cc40f",
"en_raw": "smells like a beetle"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "173434cb",
"en_raw": "Smells like a beetle?"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "d8c85bd8",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "da41e6e4",
"en_raw": "Asking me 'what' is hard"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "63d9c227",
"en_raw": "...it's just the only way to say it"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "68a2f58d",
"en_raw": "Like putting your nose close to a beetle"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "900d4816",
"en_raw": "that smell"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "e4f623cc",
"en_raw": "I don't get it at all..."
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "5c25edbf",
"en_raw": "You'll see right away if you talk to him!"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "28353603",
"en_raw": "I'm done for today"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "efa8c185",
"en_raw": "Could you make it tomorrow?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "3b4a1055",
"en_raw": "Hey, taking the dog for a walk, I see"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "e553832e",
"en_raw": "I'd like a portrait drawn"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "49013f98",
"en_raw": "You're a middle schooler... 500 yen"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "ee29ea13",
"en_raw": "500 yen..."
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "2c52b0a9",
"en_raw": "A price worth considering"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "def0dc8c",
"en_raw": "Have you made up your mind?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "66ad392b",
"en_raw": "...Not yet"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "04992ccb",
"en_raw": "Currently investigating"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "fbaa6610",
"en_raw": "You said you hate"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "59587201",
"en_raw": "being told you smell like a beetle..."
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "75f396e5",
"en_raw": "...Why?"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "d2b9a78f",
"en_raw": "I can't agree with"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "79602541",
"en_raw": "anything you're saying..."
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "c09cd5cf",
"en_raw": "Why do you think that way?"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "d43b3570",
"en_raw": "Hey, according to that logic"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "84a10283",
"en_raw": "I'm still not"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "848303df",
"en_raw": "quite convinced"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "05b0c30c",
"en_raw": "Will you explain it properly?"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "321eeacc",
"en_raw": "I've asked around"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "9b8cf063",
"en_raw": "about you"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "5f4018de",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "16afdd92",
"en_raw": "They say you have talent"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "c112fda7",
"en_raw": "I heard the badmouthing too"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "c4f9097d",
"en_raw": "Hey, you"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "d70e2a42",
"en_raw": "don't you care how"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "27be007e",
"en_raw": "other people see you?"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "f6341425",
"en_raw": "Whatever"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "23dc3c3a",
"en_raw": "Then, then"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "6ef9fdc4",
"en_raw": "may I ask one last thing?"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "9c8000c7",
"en_raw": "What does 'smells like a beetle' mean?"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "de133160",
"en_raw": "I don't mind what anyone thinks"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "9c9a0e8d",
"en_raw": "but that way of putting it"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "a674cc0e",
"en_raw": "I don't like"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "195c2039",
"en_raw": "Why?"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "d13fa564",
"en_raw": "...I can't put it into words well"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "174e1bac",
"en_raw": "but it feels really"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "ad6f38fa",
"en_raw": "arrogant"
},
{
"n": 209,
"h": "e9d2e142",
"en_raw": "I don't get it at all"
},
{
"n": 210,
"h": "148310e2",
"en_raw": "...It's the place"
},
{
"n": 211,
"h": "3cdab6f0",
"en_raw": "we should return to"
},
{
"n": 212,
"h": "cc1aeeed",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 213,
"h": "d9ed5d7f",
"en_raw": "People slowly forget the color of the sky"
},
{
"n": 214,
"h": "b353546a",
"en_raw": "and forget the smell of soil..."
},
{
"n": 215,
"h": "ae4f45a2",
"en_raw": "...For example, TV"
},
{
"n": 216,
"h": "f7dd767b",
"en_raw": "a device that numbs us to"
},
{
"n": 217,
"h": "bf593f87",
"en_raw": "major accidents and people dying"
},
{
"n": 218,
"h": "c864e18b",
"en_raw": "...For example, consumption"
},
{
"n": 219,
"h": "659e7d19",
"en_raw": "While there are people suffering without things"
},
{
"n": 220,
"h": "377e7ec6",
"en_raw": "there are people living surrounded"
},
{
"n": 221,
"h": "2977d48e",
"en_raw": "by so much it spills from their hands"
},
{
"n": 222,
"h": "82552c9a",
"en_raw": "...And"
},
{
"n": 223,
"h": "aa3b5088",
"en_raw": "the pathologically repeated"
},
{
"n": 224,
"h": "eb596b4e",
"en_raw": "nuclear tests and deforestation"
},
{
"n": 225,
"h": "e8c77a3c",
"en_raw": "Even as we talk right now"
},
{
"n": 226,
"h": "2b7a9432",
"en_raw": "beings are going extinct"
},
{
"n": 227,
"h": "9f32d2ca",
"en_raw": "I feel pain and loneliness"
},
{
"n": 228,
"h": "561116c3",
"en_raw": "...But what I can't forgive most is"
},
{
"n": 229,
"h": "f382df4f",
"en_raw": "that, for all children,"
},
{
"n": 230,
"h": "a25720be",
"en_raw": "it robs the sense of the earth"
},
{
"n": 231,
"h": "f27982da",
"en_raw": "this city noise, I can't forgive"
},
{
"n": 232,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 233,
"h": "0773e380",
"en_raw": "People can't"
},
{
"n": 234,
"h": "efd315af",
"en_raw": "live like this"
},
{
"n": 235,
"h": "07811ac2",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but..."
},
{
"n": 236,
"h": "8028e234",
"en_raw": "If you could live just drawing"
},
{
"n": 237,
"h": "24a8f577",
"en_raw": "you could complain, I suppose"
},
{
"n": 238,
"h": "2359d134",
"en_raw": "but reality is pretty harsh"
},
{
"n": 239,
"h": "36f0a9db",
"en_raw": "I grew up in"
},
{
"n": 240,
"h": "5fcb75a9",
"en_raw": "that kind of household"
},
{
"n": 241,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 242,
"h": "4571a7bd",
"en_raw": "With the bare minimum"
},
{
"n": 243,
"h": "e1d9f62c",
"en_raw": "people can live"
},
{
"n": 244,
"h": "5d3f0433",
"en_raw": "...I think the unhappiness"
},
{
"n": 245,
"h": "ec9de9bd",
"en_raw": "is being too used to"
},
{
"n": 246,
"h": "c5d53ab3",
"en_raw": "having things"
},
{
"n": 247,
"h": "22736278",
"en_raw": "So that's why"
},
{
"n": 248,
"h": "13bd5889",
"en_raw": "you wear those ragged shoes..."
},
{
"n": 249,
"h": "594b0680",
"en_raw": "But then"
},
{
"n": 250,
"h": "89ae1109",
"en_raw": "you're saying you don't work"
},
{
"n": 251,
"h": "3b077b5d",
"en_raw": "because you can live?"
},
{
"n": 252,
"h": "5b283298",
"en_raw": "...As you see"
},
{
"n": 253,
"h": "bec683be",
"en_raw": "I'm a dropout"
},
{
"n": 254,
"h": "9397816e",
"en_raw": "But I think living"
},
{
"n": 255,
"h": "dc097f0a",
"en_raw": "and working in society"
},
{
"n": 256,
"h": "e220c905",
"en_raw": "aren't the same thing"
},
{
"n": 257,
"h": "7df946fc",
"en_raw": "Why not?"
},
{
"n": 258,
"h": "4038ef92",
"en_raw": "...People should realize"
},
{
"n": 259,
"h": "38288e86",
"en_raw": "that besides rules"
},
{
"n": 260,
"h": "c31ed4b6",
"en_raw": "made by people, there are bigger rules"
},
{
"n": 261,
"h": "1e080e9b",
"en_raw": "they should notice"
},
{
"n": 262,
"h": "d7379183",
"en_raw": "Nature, the environment, like that?"
},
{
"n": 263,
"h": "a7b05a81",
"en_raw": "...That humanity will perish"
},
{
"n": 264,
"h": "11a3dc0f",
"en_raw": "is a lie, that story"
},
{
"n": 265,
"h": "eb622284",
"en_raw": "But maybe it would really"
},
{
"n": 266,
"h": "7e9ed3d2",
"en_raw": "be better if it did"
},
{
"n": 267,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 268,
"h": "d548250d",
"en_raw": "That may be true..."
},
{
"n": 269,
"h": "68207256",
"en_raw": "Everyone lives full of contradictions"
},
{
"n": 270,
"h": "1db327e0",
"en_raw": "yet"
},
{
"n": 271,
"h": "b3619b2a",
"en_raw": "with a straight face"
},
{
"n": 272,
"h": "a83a4d05",
"en_raw": "they only talk about themselves"
},
{
"n": 273,
"h": "0ff24ec9",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 274,
"h": "d8127dff",
"en_raw": "I sometimes think too"
},
{
"n": 275,
"h": "b78bafe5",
"en_raw": "that humanity should"
},
{
"n": 276,
"h": "16325136",
"en_raw": "just disappear"
},
{
"n": 277,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 278,
"h": "2faa91d9",
"en_raw": "Indeed, you're right"
},
{
"n": 279,
"h": "4d2c0fca",
"en_raw": "Contradiction, insensitivity..."
},
{
"n": 280,
"h": "1f2dc51e",
"en_raw": "It makes me angry"
},
{
"n": 281,
"h": "43db8fae",
"en_raw": "but I had given up"
},
{
"n": 282,
"h": "57e5cbc7",
"en_raw": "But when you say it"
},
{
"n": 283,
"h": "907f4a7c",
"en_raw": "to my face like that"
},
{
"n": 284,
"h": "fabffc8f",
"en_raw": "I realize"
},
{
"n": 285,
"h": "67ebe6ef",
"en_raw": "I was running away"
},
{
"n": 286,
"h": "cdee29eb",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango, we're heading home soon"
},
{
"n": 287,
"h": "a940493a",
"en_raw": "Go home alone / I'll go too  Um..."
},
{
"n": 288,
"h": "50551358",
"en_raw": "I understood"
},
{
"n": 289,
"h": "d1458966",
"en_raw": "that I was running away..."
},
{
"n": 290,
"h": "d059fc9f",
"en_raw": "And then..."
},
{
"n": 291,
"h": "f56ac59a",
"en_raw": "Sango, if this is going to be long"
},
{
"n": 292,
"h": "87865928",
"en_raw": "we're going home, but..."
},
{
"n": 293,
"h": "c9790974",
"en_raw": "Go home alone / I'll go too  Ah... wait a sec"
},
{
"n": 294,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 295,
"h": "951a5567",
"en_raw": "I'll definitely come again"
},
{
"n": 296,
"h": "5e9a491e",
"en_raw": "I'm always here"
},
{
"n": 297,
"h": "40a5a67b",
"en_raw": "Go home on your own"
},
{
"n": 298,
"h": "67d95cbc",
"en_raw": "I still have business"
},
{
"n": 299,
"h": "bfa98cbc",
"en_raw": "...Yes"
},
{
"n": 300,
"h": "4444be03",
"en_raw": "Then we'll go ahead"
},
{
"n": 301,
"h": "624f3e65",
"en_raw": "Sango"
},
{
"n": 302,
"h": "a053fdc4",
"en_raw": "Bye~"
},
{
"n": 303,
"h": "03f5905e",
"en_raw": "They left..."
},
{
"n": 304,
"h": "85d0e2c9",
"en_raw": "Well, I should be going too..."
},
{
"n": 305,
"h": "5e26388d",
"en_raw": "Hey, wait!"
},
{
"n": 306,
"h": "3c7706f1",
"en_raw": "I, I want you to"
},
{
"n": 307,
"h": "6e7c4eae",
"en_raw": "draw"
},
{
"n": 308,
"h": "8dcad23c",
"en_raw": "um... my portrait"
},
{
"n": 309,
"h": "bfa98cbc",
"en_raw": "...Yes"
},
{
"n": 310,
"h": "6c744ff7",
"en_raw": "Then today's last one is you"
},
{
"n": 311,
"h": "de44a78b",
"en_raw": "What's your name?"
},
{
"n": 312,
"h": "1005f6d1",
"en_raw": "Ma..."
},
{
"n": 313,
"h": "2f6bbe74",
"en_raw": "...Mayu Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 314,
"h": "02eb89d7",
"en_raw": "Will you listen?"
},
{
"n": 315,
"h": "917daabf",
"en_raw": "About the portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 316,
"h": "404a7672",
"en_raw": "Oh, how was it?"
},
{
"n": 317,
"h": "a8b624b9",
"en_raw": "How should I say it, amazing..."
},
{
"n": 318,
"h": "1546e90b",
"en_raw": "I feel like I found"
},
{
"n": 319,
"h": "9c946768",
"en_raw": "what I was looking for"
},
{
"n": 320,
"h": "1eedc41c",
"en_raw": "Ha ha, a bit exaggerated"
},
{
"n": 321,
"h": "144cb518",
"en_raw": "It's not exaggerated"
},
{
"n": 322,
"h": "72bb77cc",
"en_raw": "The scales fell"
},
{
"n": 323,
"h": "413b55a3",
"en_raw": "from my eyes over and over"
},
{
"n": 324,
"h": "85975091",
"en_raw": "Should I say"
},
{
"n": 325,
"h": "d95d07ae",
"en_raw": "good for you?"
},
{
"n": 326,
"h": "6396d418",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 327,
"h": "afeb8568",
"en_raw": "Then, good"
},
{
"n": 328,
"h": "a07d0bb2",
"en_raw": "You always say things"
},
{
"n": 329,
"h": "cf7add3f",
"en_raw": "that sound a bit off..."
},
{
"n": 330,
"h": "d1847afc",
"en_raw": "Is there something"
},
{
"n": 331,
"h": "ef0e6d16",
"en_raw": "you don't like?"
},
{
"n": 332,
"h": "0f2980f0",
"en_raw": "Don't worry about it"
},
{
"n": 333,
"h": "8963fa3e",
"en_raw": "...Oh well"
},
{
"n": 334,
"h": "9c212053",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 335,
"h": "2b40dcce",
"en_raw": "Hey, listen?"
},
{
"n": 336,
"h": "064c3f28",
"en_raw": "I'm tired..."
},
{
"n": 337,
"h": "91fe29e3",
"en_raw": "No, I don't"
},
{
"n": 338,
"h": "4f63fd81",
"en_raw": "have time to be tired like that"
},
{
"n": 339,
"h": "de11a878",
"en_raw": "We have, toward the future"
},
{
"n": 340,
"h": "3ac3de9b",
"en_raw": "tons of things to do"
},
{
"n": 341,
"h": "451995a6",
"en_raw": "No, I'm fine"
},
{
"n": 342,
"h": "3bb9820b",
"en_raw": "There you go again"
},
{
"n": 343,
"h": "0eb46040",
"en_raw": "Let's do it properly"
},
{
"n": 344,
"h": "47babc9f",
"en_raw": "Come on, don't look so resigned"
},
{
"n": 345,
"h": "8d5bda61",
"en_raw": "selling old magazines"
},
{
"n": 346,
"h": "02d39775",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but you scare off customers"
},
{
"n": 347,
"h": "657a732d",
"en_raw": "go away"
},
{
"n": 348,
"h": "816417be",
"en_raw": "Ugh, what a hopeless man"
},
{
"n": 349,
"h": "e49aed55",
"en_raw": "No, I'm fine..."
},
{
"n": 350,
"h": "9c212053",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 351,
"h": "5c81373f",
"en_raw": "Hey, got a minute?"
},
{
"n": 352,
"h": "ff41dfdf",
"en_raw": "How was the portrait artist?"
},
{
"n": 353,
"h": "d680731c",
"en_raw": "The best, I felt fate"
},
{
"n": 354,
"h": "193c2a4c",
"en_raw": "in that encounter"
},
{
"n": 355,
"h": "283ff664",
"en_raw": "Is that so"
},
{
"n": 356,
"h": "ab33f243",
"en_raw": "What, is that all?"
},
{
"n": 357,
"h": "146830ed",
"en_raw": "When someone's this moved"
},
{
"n": 358,
"h": "b09a7063",
"en_raw": "Being moved is a good thing"
},
{
"n": 359,
"h": "266f7333",
"en_raw": "Get moved a lot and grow big"
},
{
"n": 360,
"h": "41209da9",
"en_raw": "Tch, treating me like a kid!"
},
{
"n": 361,
"h": "b121afcd",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 362,
"h": "3b7dcc51",
"en_raw": "Yahoo, girl!"
},
{
"n": 363,
"h": "39671c39",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, what does the artist"
},
{
"n": 364,
"h": "9e0a7445",
"en_raw": "guy think?"
},
{
"n": 365,
"h": "d0ec8037",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but I"
},
{
"n": 366,
"h": "8de919d9",
"en_raw": "quit living with"
},
{
"n": 367,
"h": "2113feee",
"en_raw": "a simple mindset like yours"
},
{
"n": 368,
"h": "e0aeba20",
"en_raw": "Oh my"
},
{
"n": 369,
"h": "6946fd87",
"en_raw": "You should think"
},
{
"n": 370,
"h": "f57e0c0d",
"en_raw": "a little too"
},
{
"n": 371,
"h": "2b16b74b",
"en_raw": "about people living"
},
{
"n": 372,
"h": "6fa6e952",
"en_raw": "like human beings"
},
{
"n": 373,
"h": "c60379a0",
"en_raw": "What a shame"
},
{
"n": 374,
"h": "de79f2bb",
"en_raw": "completely brainwashed"
},
{
"n": 375,
"h": "1039bdd1",
"en_raw": "I thought we'd be good friends"
},
{
"n": 376,
"h": "011dc147",
"en_raw": "I won't argue"
},
{
"n": 377,
"h": "84755907",
"en_raw": "I really like"
},
{
"n": 378,
"h": "2040da08",
"en_raw": "the me I am now"
},
{
"n": 379,
"h": "0a5992cc",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but could you not bother me?"
},
{
"n": 380,
"h": "a4cc0833",
"en_raw": "Probably no matter how much I talk to you"
},
{
"n": 381,
"h": "07806d2a",
"en_raw": "we'd be parallel lines"
},
{
"n": 382,
"h": "805a4695",
"en_raw": "I came again"
},
{
"n": 383,
"h": "bb9d8cc0",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi... was it?"
},
{
"n": 384,
"h": "49a57d4b",
"en_raw": "You remembered my name"
},
{
"n": 385,
"h": "89f066b8",
"en_raw": "Hey, do you have a moment?"
},
{
"n": 386,
"h": "a0ebbd74",
"en_raw": "Yesterday I"
},
{
"n": 387,
"h": "3f931f38",
"en_raw": "thought about a lot of things"
},
{
"n": 388,
"h": "1a7b6458",
"en_raw": "To talk more brightly about"
},
{
"n": 389,
"h": "545a5029",
"en_raw": "the future and stuff"
},
{
"n": 390,
"h": "a46514bd",
"en_raw": "what should I do?"
},
{
"n": 391,
"h": "efafd839",
"en_raw": "That's a good thing"
},
{
"n": 392,
"h": "21e11108",
"en_raw": "I could read books"
},
{
"n": 393,
"h": "817d69a1",
"en_raw": "but to understand with the heart, not the head"
},
{
"n": 394,
"h": "1f5604ba",
"en_raw": "you'd have to actually live like you do"
},
{
"n": 395,
"h": "062359a9",
"en_raw": "it's impossible otherwise"
},
{
"n": 396,
"h": "37aa783f",
"en_raw": "If possible, I'd like to"
},
{
"n": 397,
"h": "88bc62bc",
"en_raw": "do so right away"
},
{
"n": 398,
"h": "5296c976",
"en_raw": "but I'm still a middle schooler..."
},
{
"n": 399,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 400,
"h": "3ddab4c1",
"en_raw": "And so, I thought I had to"
},
{
"n": 401,
"h": "339529a2",
"en_raw": "talk with you more"
},
{
"n": 402,
"h": "ed788457",
"en_raw": "It's what I'd hoped for, but..."
},
{
"n": 403,
"h": "a77f59a6",
"en_raw": "I have to earn at least"
},
{
"n": 404,
"h": "db05b954",
"en_raw": "today's bread, too"
},
{
"n": 405,
"h": "93a6a3aa",
"en_raw": "Oh, right, you're working"
},
{
"n": 406,
"h": "0d027b10",
"en_raw": "...Well, sort of"
},
{
"n": 407,
"h": "543fefa3",
"en_raw": "Then how about this?"
},
{
"n": 408,
"h": "ea84c7af",
"en_raw": "Draw me again?"
},
{
"n": 409,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 410,
"h": "4c12e5ec",
"en_raw": "What's wrong? No good?"
},
{
"n": 411,
"h": "786ae458",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but I"
},
{
"n": 412,
"h": "f982f539",
"en_raw": "can't draw the same motif"
},
{
"n": 413,
"h": "b8942792",
"en_raw": "twice..."
},
{
"n": 414,
"h": "9a53e81d",
"en_raw": "...I see"
},
{
"n": 415,
"h": "1580eb2a",
"en_raw": "Yeah, then, too bad"
},
{
"n": 416,
"h": "62ec120a",
"en_raw": "I'll give up today"
},
{
"n": 417,
"h": "1800cad0",
"en_raw": "Well, good luck"
},
{
"n": 418,
"h": "03942332",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 419,
"h": "7fff8aac",
"en_raw": "It seems I'm intruding"
},
{
"n": 420,
"h": "7a946ea5",
